                                                "sense_id": "9995426b-816a-37da-a353-1a32428d7912",
                                                "text": "In person, Huff looks exactly as she does on her massively popular Instagram account, her sheer foundation and subtle bronze eyeshadow catching the spotlight just like they do the ring light. She has the cross-platform ease of someone who’s been famous forever because she basically has been."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0767de4e-2514-3ac8-87f2-a4ac44a833c2",
                                        "entry_id": "24ef59b6-d8a3-31d6-823f-a7434cedad28",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of software, etc., designed to work on various operating systems."
                                        ],
